[03] G2 backend implemented (backend/app/plugins/expiry_tracker.py):
     - _orphan_manual_tasks(db, asset, evidence_ids): among Candidate rows with
       state == SPLIT_ORIGIN_STATE and same household, keep those whose
       evidence_ids_json intersects the asset's linked evidence; return their open
       expiry.manual_entry tasks. Lazy import of Candidate/SPLIT_ORIGIN_STATE avoids any
       plugins<->services import cycle at registry load.
     - store_manual_expiry: after resolving own subject_ref=asset.id tasks, resolve each
       orphan (skip duplicates), set status="resolved", record a review_task.resolve audit
       with resolution {"manual_entry_orphan": True, "asset_id": asset.id}; append to the
       returned task list so resolved_review_task_ids carries own + orphan without any
       api/v1/plugins.py change. Never deletes a task.
